(
F5 T4 U8: geometry_moving {manual Professional 6.533-6.538} sample points against the analytic volume fraction.
A 2 x 2 quad4 mesh on 0..1 x 0..1. A -geometry_point of radius 0.1 starts at -0.5 0.25 and translates with velocity 1 0 from time 0 to 2: it sweeps the band y 0.15..0.35.
The bottom elements {height 0.5} lie 0.2 / 0.5 = 0.4 inside the band; geometry_moving_n 20 10 gives 10 x 10 cell midpoints, 4 of the 10 rows {y 0.175 0.225 0.275 0.325} enter: part 0.4 = analytic.
Entry times {sample before the first moment inside}: element 1 0.4 and 0.9, element 2 0.9 and 1.4; leave times {last moment inside}: element 1 0.5 and 1.0, element 2 1.0 and 1.5. The top elements are not touched {no records}.
The Professional 02-08-2026 tests the nodes {none is within 0.1 of the path}: no element is excavated, class D divergence GEOMETRY-MOVING-SAMPLING.
control_geometry_moving at an index without timesteps: the records are written at the initialisation.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0. 0.
node 2 0.5 0.
node 3 1. 0.
node 4 0. 0.5
node 5 0.5 0.5
node 6 1. 0.5
node 7 0. 1.
node 8 0.5 1.
node 9 1. 1.
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
element 3 -quad4 4 5 7 8
element 4 -quad4 5 6 8 9
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.e4
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
geometry_moving 10 -geometry_point
geometry_moving_parameter 10 -0.5 0.25 0.1
geometry_moving_operat 10 -translate
geometry_moving_operat_parameter 10 1. 0.
geometry_moving_operat_time 10 0. 2.
geometry_moving_n 10 20 10
control_geometry_moving 5 -initialise
end_data
